{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"一、十有一年。春王正月，叔弓如宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"二、葬宋平公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"三、夏四月丁巳，楚子虔誘蔡侯般，殺之于申。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"楚子虔何以名？絕。曷為絕之？為其誘封也。此討賊也，雖誘之則曷為絕之？懷惡而討不義，君子不予也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"四、楚公子棄疾帥師圍蔡。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"五、五月甲申，夫人歸氏薨。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"六、大蒐于比蒲。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"大蒐者何？簡車徒也。何以書？蓋以罕書也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"七、仲孫貜會邾婁子盟于侵羊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"八、秋，季孫隱如會晉韓起、齊國酌、宋華亥、衞北宮佗、鄭軒虎、曹人、〈木巳〉人于屈銀。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"九、九月己亥，葬我小君齊歸。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"齊歸者何？昭公之母也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"十、冬十有一月丁酉，楚師滅蔡，執蔡世子有以歸，用之。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_191_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_191","textTraditional":"此未踰年之君也，其稱世子何？不君靈公不成其子也。不君靈公，則曷為不成其子？誅君之子不立，非怒也，無繼也。惡乎用之？用之防也。其用之防奈何？蓋以築防也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}